@大风起兮云飞扬 Heya! It can only be 2 things:
Nº1 - You're using Lag Compensation, the pop-up warns you about it because it is highly advised to not use it, it messes with stuff, sometimes you can even get attacked by something that isn't even doing anything, but without lag compensation, it would look normal. For this you have the option to mark a "do not show me this again" in the pop-up, it won't show up again if you enable that.
Nº2 - We have a joke config, which is off-by-default, that simulates annoying pop-ups and whatnot. It is a joke thing, but if you have that enabled without knowing, it could be pretty annoying. This configs is in the bottom of the config pages, named "Fun Mode".

